Comment: 0,0:00:01.38,0:00:02.88,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,Ep.7 Start
Comment: 0,-1:59:59.99,-1:59:59.99,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Even though the Yamato can shoot, it won't.
Comment: 0,0:17:04.55,0:17:07.24,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Hang in there, old man.\N We're almost there.
Comment: 0,0:22:35.09,0:22:43.94,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,Ep. 7 Drastic turn! Flash of the Wave-motion Gun
Comment: 0,-1:59:59.99,-1:59:59.99,def2,CAST1,0,0,0,,Susumu Kodai: Daisuke Ono/nDaisuke Shima: Kenich Suzumura/nShiro Sanada: Hochu Otsuka/nYasuo Nanbu: Kenji Akabane/nYoshikazu Aihara: Masato Kokubun
Comment: 0,-1:59:59.99,-1:59:59.99,def2,CAST2,0,0,0,,Kenjiro Ohta: Yuki Chiba/nHikozaemon Tokugawa: Mugihito/nAnalyzer: Cho/nMiki Saijo: Satomi Moriya/nHiroki Shinohara: Daisuke Hirata/n
Comment: 0,-1:59:59.99,-1:59:59.99,def2,CAST3,0,0,0,,Akira Yamamoto: Rie Tanaka/nJiro Tsurumi: Keisuke Komoto/nHajime Saito: Hiroki Tochi/nMasaru Kurata: Kiyohito Yoshikai/nJuzo Okita: Takayuki Sugao/nRyu Hijikata: Unsho Ishizuka
Comment: 0,-1:59:59.99,-1:59:59.99,def2,CAST4,0,0,0,,Keyman: Hiroshi Kamiya/nStarsia: Kikuko Inoue/nZorder: Hideaki Tezuka/nSabera: Yuko Kaida/nGailane: Hidekatsu Shibata/nBalsey: Tomomichi Nishimura/nLasera/nKouki Harasawa/nCosmodart: Toshiya Kawai/nMaser: Shigeo Kiyama
Comment: 0,-1:59:59.99,-1:59:59.99,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,Ep. 8: Trap on the Planet Stravase !

Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.18,0:00:39.58,Karaoke Translation op,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\fscx150\fscy120\c&H000000&\move(342,350,318,348,1,4380)}Space Battleship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:39.58,yamato,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\c&H0000FF&\fscx347\fscy257\pos(868,926)}Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.78,0:00:39.58,Karaoke Translation op,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\fscx167\fscy142\c&H000000&\move(1490,872,1510,886,3,3840)}Soldiers of Love
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.25,0:02:16.36,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,Intelligence Archive Secretary Gailane,\N trace the record of the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.72,0:02:17.45,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.56,0:02:30.55,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,This was observed in the Balan Star \NSystem, 31.72 hebron miles away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.59,0:02:48.13,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,What incredible power !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.49,0:02:50.48,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,That ship is dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.48,0:02:54.12,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Inform Maser's fleet, since they've been\N ordered to invade the Zol system.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.12,0:02:55.63,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,There's no need.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.63,0:02:56.43,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Sir ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.43,0:02:57.72,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,It won't shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.60,0:03:02.74,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Even though the Yamato can shoot, it won't.{The Yamato won't shoot.}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.34,0:03:23.58,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\pos(966,1040)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&}11th Planet of the Solar System
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.91,0:03:32.10,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,What a mess. Where's the Yamato...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.64,0:03:35.63,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,This is Yamamoto of the Cosmo Tigers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.63,0:03:37.08,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Yamato, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.08,0:03:37.82,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Yamato...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.68,0:03:41.20,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Respond...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.20,0:03:42.20,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,...please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.88,0:03:49.83,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The wave motion shield is nearing its pressure limit !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.83,0:03:52.34,def2,SANANDA,0,0,0,,One minute until wave motion shield failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.04,0:03:57.58,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}We don't have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.58,0:04:00.91,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Keep the condition stable, and start up the sub-engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.67,0:04:04.98,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Send all energy to the main engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.68,0:04:08.78,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Hurry. The wave motion shield\N won't hold much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.78,0:04:10.66,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,The Yamato will be crushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.32,0:04:12.53,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,How is it, Analyzer ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.24,0:04:18.84,def2,ANALYZER,0,0,0,,The block that can hold up the\N cave by dispersing the load...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.62,0:04:21.11,def2,ANALYZER,0,0,0,,...identified.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.99,0:04:24.83,def2,KO,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire magnetron probes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.00,0:04:27.56,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,Fire !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.25,0:04:35.37,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Emit magnetron wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.64,0:04:37.88,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Losing the wave motion shield in five...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.88,0:04:38.88,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,...four...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.88,0:04:39.88,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,...three...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.88,0:04:40.88,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,...two...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.88,0:04:41.36,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,...one...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.37,0:04:53.62,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Probes are working normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.89,0:04:55.43,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,It worked.{'s successful.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.43,0:04:56.71,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,It's close, but holding.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.49,0:05:19.63,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Admiral Maser, there's a faint energy signature.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.63,0:05:23.88,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}That Earth ship, the Yamato, appears to be intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.88,0:05:27.53,def2,MASER,0,0,0,,Ignore it. \NHis Majesty has made his decision. {[did I use excellency? It's more like majesty, isn't it?]}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.53,0:05:32.23,def2,MASER,0,0,0,,Fortunately, we're allowed\Nto use the Legionella Kanone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.23,0:05:34.13,def2,MASER,0,0,0,,Speed up the preparations.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.13,0:05:34.69,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.82,0:05:41.91,def2,MASER,0,0,0,,This is the final look of a fake sun, \Nwhich sheds light on this remote planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.33,0:05:55.47,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,So many of them...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.18,0:05:57.95,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Any word from the Yamato ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.61,0:06:01.71,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Everyone's safe. \NThey can take off as soon as repairs are finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.29,0:06:05.33,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,You'd better send this data to the Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.08,0:06:08.53,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,...although knowing that won't change the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.48,0:06:12.68,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Any problems ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.68,0:06:13.53,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.43,0:06:19.99,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,An emotionless observation from a heartless person.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.98,0:06:23.42,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,My translator may be malfunctioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.23,0:06:26.23,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Then why don't you take it off ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.23,0:06:31.01,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Understanding languages without \Nsome emotional connection is confusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.72,0:06:36.26,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Tsurumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.44,0:06:37.78,def2,TSURUMI,0,0,0,,Y...yes ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.78,0:06:41.51,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Get the emergency rations from my \Nplane and take them to the Garmillan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.70,0:06:47.96,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Even he gets hungry, right ? \NYou guys should eat, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.11,0:06:50.23,def2,TSURUMI,0,0,0,,O...okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.32,0:07:07.91,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Please forgive Commander Kato.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.29,0:07:14.32,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,His son is ill, and his wife is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.46,0:07:16.78,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.78,0:07:20.71,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Kato believes that the\N Yamato will overcome this crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.94,0:07:23.88,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,That's why he snapped at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.04,0:07:29.11,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,But the Yamato is different from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.51,0:07:36.22,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Everyone should be aware of it,\Nbut no one openly talks about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.22,0:07:41.41,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{sekinin}Letting the Acting Captain shoulder all \Nthe burden, is why we're in this situation.{which resulted in this situation.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.88,0:07:49.82,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,You've been against this operation since the beginning, haven't you, Lieutenant ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.10,0:07:55.20,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Even so, the fact is, the\N Yamato did save a lot of lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.70,0:08:01.33,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,If it can escape safely, Kodai's decision\N will turn out to be the correct one.{turns out correct.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.84,0:08:06.19,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,He's stubborn, but not foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.21,0:08:11.08,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Quite a lot, isn't it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.08,0:08:16.02,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,According to Keyman, there were more \Nwarp-outs after this data was sampled.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.98,0:08:18.03,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Analyzer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.30,0:08:18.99,def2,ANALYZER,0,0,0,,Yes ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.99,0:08:23.92,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,The enemy fleet's formation seems abnormal.\NCheck the data so far, and predict their next move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.45,0:08:25.30,def2,ANALYZER,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.30,0:08:26.83,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,So you're the Acting Captain, huh ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.22,0:08:28.78,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Who are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.78,0:08:32.31,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,I'm Saito Hajime, commander of\N the Space Cavalry 7th Regiment. {did we use Marine?}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.05,0:08:35.70,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,First, you have my utmost gratitude\N from the bottom of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.87,0:08:41.40,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,More than two hundred people were rescued. \NThank you so much for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.68,0:08:45.46,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,That being said, \NI have a question for the Acting Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.32,0:08:48.63,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,{anta}Hey, what're you waiting for ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.63,0:08:51.99,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,{anta}Why doesn't the Yamato fire the wave motion gun ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.55,0:08:56.44,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I have no answer for an outsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.07,0:09:00.26,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,You're responsible for the people you've saved, aren't you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.26,0:09:02.00,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Hey, knock if off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.00,0:09:08.38,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Many of the survivors think they can return to Earth because they're on the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.38,0:09:11.23,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,They believe so because it's the Yamato !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.23,0:09:15.12,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,{hadoho}How're you going to escape this planet\N without using the wave motion gun ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.83,0:09:16.62,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,Tell me !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.62,0:09:17.23,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,Keep it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.61,0:09:20.58,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,It's an SOS...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.58,0:09:22.28,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,...from the destroyed command center !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.59,0:09:23.23,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,What ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.23,0:09:25.06,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Aihara, let me hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.46,0:09:30.48,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Remaining forces...if you can hear...command center.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.48,0:09:33.20,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}{chika ni}...survivors below ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.20,0:09:36.20,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Commander Hijikata...badly injured...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.87,0:09:38.92,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,The old man's alive ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.70,0:09:50.95,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,This is Kato from the fighter squadron.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.00,0:09:56.32,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}The command center was assumed destroyed, but we\Nconfirmed some survivors, including Commander Hijikata.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.86,0:09:58.12,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Commander Hijikata ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.38,0:09:59.23,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.23,0:10:01.46,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,...the Space Cavalry's on its way to rescue them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.46,0:10:02.88,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,The radar is back online.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.97,0:10:06.51,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,Enemy fleet confirmed, putting it on the main panel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.59,0:10:09.58,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Why so many ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.58,0:10:12.63,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,Many enemy ships are still warping out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.63,0:10:15.28,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,It's exceeded 15,000 ships !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.28,0:10:19.83,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Cosmo Tiger squadron, stand by \Nand wait for my orders. That'll be all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.83,0:10:20.50,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.11,0:10:22.80,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Could that be...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.59,0:10:24.80,def2,ANALZER,0,0,0,,Analysis complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.21,0:10:30.71,def2,ANALZER,0,0,0,,The enemy Calakmul-class battleships\N are forming a gigantic cylinder.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.46,0:10:34.73,def2,ANALZER,0,0,0,,Expected time of completion is 10:20.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.73,0:10:38.14,def2,ANALZER,0,0,0,,Expected total number of ships: approximately 2,500,000.{Expected ship size is 2,500,000.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.81,0:10:41.93,def2,ANALZER,0,0,0,,The cylinder is believed to be\N some kind of accelerator, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.93,0:10:50.49,def2,ANALZER,0,0,0,,{kidou}...upon contact, the artificial sun in orbit will explode, eliminating everything within a 20,000 km radius.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.09,0:10:53.03,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,Supernova explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.61,0:10:55.98,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,That shape could be...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.55,0:10:58.78,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Kodai, we have to hurry and escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.78,0:10:59.38,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.93,0:11:06.91,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Analyzer, suppose the formation acts as a cannon, are there any planets in its line of fire ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.69,0:11:16.98,def2,ANALYZER,0,0,0,,If such supernova energy is used by the expected size of the \Nenemy fleet, there's only one planet within its effective range.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.80,0:11:18.97,def2,ANALYZER,0,0,0,,Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.27,0:12:38.95,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,If anyone's alive, say something !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.86,0:12:43.88,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,You sound rough, commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.36,0:12:45.48,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Old Man !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.44,0:12:59.08,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Please, promise me. {OKITA: I promise.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.08,0:12:59.68,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.68,0:13:01.18,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Please, promise me. {OKITA: I promise.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.18,0:13:01.78,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.78,0:13:03.68,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Please, promise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.68,0:13:05.28,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.28,0:13:05.88,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Please, promise me. {OKITA: I promise.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.88,0:13:08.29,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.29,0:13:11.38,def2,OKITA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Kodai, show your resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.11,0:13:14.22,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Resolve ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.58,0:13:20.05,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,What do you mean by resolve, Captain Okita ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.60,0:13:30.27,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.47,0:13:37.38,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Kodai, let's use the wave motion gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.08,0:13:42.68,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,We have no other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.68,0:13:48.78,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,If that massive cannon is real, \Nthe damage to Earth will be immeasurable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.78,0:13:49.91,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,He promised...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.62,0:13:59.84,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Captain Okita promised Starsia that\N we'd never use the wave motion gun again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.84,0:14:04.58,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Mr. Sanada, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.58,0:14:13.56,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I just want to do what I'm supposed to do, like keeping a promise or reaching out to those seeking help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.71,0:14:16.23,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{minna}Don't you think that's how it's supposed to be ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.38,0:14:18.01,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.70,0:14:25.98,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I'd be ashamed of being a resident of Earth if its people didn't have common sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.42,0:14:31.51,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,If I could, I want to prove that\N the people of Earth aren't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.71,0:14:34.74,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,That's why the Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.52,0:14:42.99,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Despite that, we must break our \Npromise and risk thousands of lives...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.10,0:15:28.86,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,Acting Captain, Lieutenant Keyman's hailing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.83,0:15:31.55,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Kodai, it's dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.63,0:15:41.02,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,You might not be able to tell from down there, but the light of the artificial sun we installed is actually kind of beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.92,0:15:59.60,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lieutenant Keyman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.24,0:16:01.38,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.32,0:16:07.06,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,The ship will begin the wave motion gun firing sequence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.08,0:16:12.65,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Start the sub engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.08,0:16:14.47,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Starting the sub engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.16,0:16:21.48,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Kodai, aim for the sun when it \Nreaches the center of those battleships.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.54,0:17:08.23,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Old Man. \NWe're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.23,0:17:10.71,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,The Yamato's got a skilled doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.29,0:17:30.88,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Commander, it's the Yamato !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.88,0:17:31.58,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,What ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.20,0:17:55.68,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Kodai, fire the wave motion gun !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.31,0:18:03.97,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,You won't shoot our enemy even \Nthough they're right in front of you, Kodai ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.97,0:18:04.68,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.18,0:18:07.46,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Kodai will shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.40,0:18:14.53,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Admiral Maser, the Legionella Kanone \Npreparations are complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.18,0:18:18.24,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}The sun will soon be\Nconnected to the core point.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.93,0:18:22.41,def2,MASER,0,0,0,,Good. \NPrepare to fire the Legionella Kanone !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.31,0:18:37.26,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Open the channel to the wave motion gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.26,0:18:38.68,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,Opening the channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.68,0:18:42.98,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Shut down all emergency valves. \NActivate the forced injector.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.99,0:18:46.23,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Forced injector, activation confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.23,0:18:47.61,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Release the final safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.50,0:18:53.68,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,Tachyon particle pressure rising in the chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.68,0:18:55.90,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,Energy charge, 120%.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.38,0:18:58.58,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire the wave motion gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.68,0:19:01.59,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,The Yamato is going to shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.22,0:19:04.19,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Take anti-shock and flash measures.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.80,0:19:07.40,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Target scope, open.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.10,0:19:10.63,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Optical cross gauge brightness 100.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.63,0:19:11.96,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Ten seconds till firing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.66,0:19:18.07,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,A number of cold spots appeared on the artificial sun. Energy transfer to the enemy fleet detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.89,0:19:19.88,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Three...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.88,0:19:20.68,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,...two...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.68,0:19:21.27,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,...one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.48,0:19:26.38,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Fire !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.95,0:19:55.73,def2,MASER,0,0,0,,What ? What's happening ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.73,0:20:00.31,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Some kind of interference wave caused\N every ships' engine to malfunction.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.90,0:20:20.28,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Same principle as the special \Ndepth-charge from before ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.28,0:20:21.63,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.63,0:20:27.98,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,A direct hit to the artificial sun's reactor generates interference waves because of the resonance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.98,0:20:30.23,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{korede}They'll be immobilized for quite a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.46,0:20:34.08,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,You saved us again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.08,0:20:38.40,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,The sun is beautiful at dawn.\N That's all I told him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.98,0:20:43.55,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}This is Acting Captain Kodai Susumu\Nof the space battleship Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.60,0:20:48.61,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}At present, our ship's firepower\N can annihilate your entire fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.63,0:20:52.10,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}However, I do not wish any further hostilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.14,0:20:55.46,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}I request that you quietly leave this space zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.30,0:20:59.39,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}If you do, we will not attack you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.65,0:21:04.95,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Although we come from different planets, we're\N both human. I expect a wise decision from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.04,0:21:07.28,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Did he forgive...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.28,0:21:09.43,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Did he forgive our enemy ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.16,0:21:17.30,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,His way is not wrong, but that's only\N if the enemy shares the same mentality.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.67,0:21:20.98,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,This opponent is different from Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.18,0:21:25.34,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,We might end up paying a huge price.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.87,0:21:30.98,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Run.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.98,0:21:36.73,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}He told us to run,\Ninstead of killing or capturing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.73,0:21:39.58,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Why did the Yamato let us live ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.77,0:21:44.28,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}I...I just can't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.28,0:21:45.78,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}That's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.66,0:21:48.13,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,That's love.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.35,0:22:03.88,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,You fired it, and saved the\N Earth without killing anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.63,0:22:05.56,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.27,0:22:11.75,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,The truth is I fired the wave \Nmotion gun by deceiving myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.76,0:22:13.55,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.75,0:22:17.72,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I know, I won't say that to anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.55,0:22:26.87,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Even if I'm deceiving myself, I must start from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.08,0:22:44.93,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(212,874)}Episode 7
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.08,0:22:44.93,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(440,1046)}Drastic Turn! Flash of the Wave Motion Gun
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.08,0:22:58.43,Karaoke Translation op,CAST1,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\a3\pos(1194,586)}Kodai Susumu:\NShima Daisuke:\NSanada Shiro:\NNanbu Yasuo:\NAihara Yoshikazu:\NOhta Kenjiro:\NTokugawa Hikozaemon:\NAnalyzer:\NSaijo Miki:\NKato Saburo:\NShinohara Hiroki:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.08,0:22:58.43,Karaoke Translation op,CAST1,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\a5\pos(1236,148)}Ono Daisuke\NSuzumura Kenichi \NOtsuka Hochu\NAkabane Kenji \NKokubun Masato\NChiba Yuki\NMugihito\NCho\NMoriya Satomi\NHosoya Yoshimasa\NHirata Daisuke
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.43,0:23:07.28,Karaoke Translation op,CAST2,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\a3\pos(1208,762)}Yamamoto Akira:\NTsurumi Jiro:\NSaito Hajime: \NKurata Masaru:\NOkita Juzo\NHijikata Ryu:\NKeyman:\NStarsia:\NZorder:\NSabera:\NGailane:\NBalsey:\NLasera:\NCosmodart: \NMaser:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.43,0:23:07.28,Karaoke Translation op,CAST2,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\a5\pos(1246,162)}Tanaka Rie\NKomoto Keisuke\NTochi Hiroki \NYoshikai Kiyohito\NSugao Takayuki\NIshizuka Unsho\NKamiya Hiroshi\NInoue Kikuko\NTezuka Hideaki \NKaida Yuko\NShibata Hidekatsu\NNishimura Tomomichi \NHarasawa Kouki \NKawai Toshiya\NKiyama Shigeo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.61,0:22:53.83,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kienai de aoi tsuki yo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.61,0:22:53.83,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Blue moon, please don't fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.83,0:23:01.70,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Terashidasu kimi hitohira
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.83,0:23:01.70,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}It lights up my love just enough
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.83,0:23:18.93,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Nani hitotsu kawaranai
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.83,0:23:18.93,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Everything was routine
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.91,0:23:25.22,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Monotone iro no hibi
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.91,0:23:25.22,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Monotone days for so long
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.15,0:23:31.22,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Unmei ga tsurete kita
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.15,0:23:31.22,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Fate brought you to me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.22,0:23:37.59,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kimi no me ni koi wo shita
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.22,0:23:37.59,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I fell in love with your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.16,0:23:43.55,def2,endsong,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Chikaku ni kanjitai yo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.16,0:23:43.55,def2,endsong,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I want to feel you close
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.98,0:23:50.52,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Atatakai te ni furete
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.98,0:23:50.52,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Touching your warm hands
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.76,0:23:56.13,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Aa sugu ni kotoba ni dekitara
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.76,0:23:56.13,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Wishing I could put this into words right away
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.85,0:24:02.20,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Konnani ai shiteru
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.85,0:24:02.20,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I love you so much
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.66,0:24:08.40,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kakurenai de koigokoro yo
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.66,0:24:08.40,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Loving feelings, please don't hide
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.80,0:24:14.18,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kimi dake terashiteru yo
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.80,0:24:14.18,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}It sheds light only on you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.96,0:24:21.14,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Konya nara sou ieru
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.96,0:24:21.14,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I can say that because tonight is different
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.13,0:24:44.58,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(970,662)}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.03,0:24:47.90,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,I feel like Okita is still on this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.90,0:24:49.09,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Identify yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.09,0:24:50.28,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,It's like a graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.28,0:24:52.49,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,A civilian went off to the ruins ?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.49,0:24:53.72,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this, Keyman ?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.72,0:24:55.25,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Kodai, where are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.25,0:24:57.43,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,My name is Zorder...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.13,0:24:58.13,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\fscx135\fscy103\pos(964,462)}Episode 08
